{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37455","headline":"红叶 · 唐彦谦","name":"红叶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无处不飘扬，高楼临道旁。\n素娥前夕月，青女夜来霜。\n宿雨随时润，秋晴着物光。\n幽怀长若此，病眼更相妨。\n蜀纸裁深色，燕脂落靓粧。\n低丛侵小阁，倒影入回塘。\n谢朓留霞绮，甘宁弃锦张。\n何人休远道，是处有斜阳。\n薜荔垂书幌，梧桐坠井牀。\n晚风生旅馆，寒籁近僧房。\n桂绿明淮甸，枫丹照楚乡。\n鴈疎临鄠杜，蝉急傍潇湘。\n树异桓宣武，园非顾辟疆。\n茂陵愁卧客，不自保危肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37455.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37455","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}